{'symbol': 'PAYX', 'date': '2022-10-14 09:00:00', 'title': 'PAYCHEX EXPANDS BOARD, APPOINTS PRESIDENT AND CEO JOHN B. GIBSON, JR.', 'text': "ROCHESTER, N.Y. , OCT. 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PAYCHEX, INC., A LEADING PROVIDER OF INTEGRATED HUMAN CAPITAL MANAGEMENT SOFTWARE SOLUTIONS FOR HUMAN RESOURCES, PAYROLL, BENEFITS, AND INSURANCE SERVICES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS VOTED TO EXPAND FROM 10 TO 11 MEMBERS."}